cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HAARPi: Human Authored Agentic Research Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A six-stage agentic research system spanning literature review, experiment
  design, model building, experiments, manuscript and presentation, in which
  every stage terminates in a human-reviewed document and no stage advances
  without markup. Offline-first: the working loops run on local open-weight
  models, so a research project need never leave the machine.
authors:
